        val, array_index, element_index = heapq.heappop(min_heap)

        if val < min_range[0]:
            min_range = (val, val + 1)

        if element_index + 1 < len(arrays[array_index]):
            next_val = arrays[array_index][element_index + 1]
            heapq.heappush(min_heap, (next_val, array_index, element_index + 1))

    return min_range
```

